-| WMO | app presets ∩ live `dac/incois` membership | floats absent from `dac/incois` (e.g. US-DAC 6902892/6903014) get an explicit unavailable state, never fabricated data |
-| Internal ID | app registries (PTT, else IMEI) | identity only, not a comms signal; the 301/CTS4 reference carries no PTT/IMEI (staged SBD IMEIs are redacted), so those floats honestly show "—" |
-| Float Type | app preset `platform_type` | same label as the rest of the UI |
-| Prof# | max cycle `ccc` across `profiles/` filenames (R/D/BR/BD/SR/SD union) | filename-based, no download |
-| # Profs Missing | gaps in cycle sequence 1..Prof# (cycle 0 excluded) | e.g. 1902844 → {22} = 1 |
-| Lon / Lat | latest upstream profile LATITUDE/LONGITUDE (POSITION_QC recorded, ranges validated); fallback = trajectory last valid fix (max-JULD non-fill position row); else unavailable | freshest honest upstream position drives table + map; both shown in detail |
-| Last Transmission | §1 field, ISO UTC | minute-display precision |
-| No Transmission | `(now − last_tx)` in days (float; UI shows floored `Nd`) | recomputed at serve time — always fresh without re-sync |
-| Expected Next | last_tx + 10 days | |
-| Trajectory-behind-profiles | latest profile JULD newer than traj last-tx | honest DAC-lag indicator (observed on 1902844: traj May 2026, profiles Sep 2026); both timestamps shown |
