-## 3. Status rules
-
-Computed backend-side at serve time from cached last-tx + wall clock:
-
-- `ACTIVE` — within the expected 10-day window (`days_since ≤ 10`)
-- `OVERDUE` — expected date passed, under 60 days (`10 < days_since < 60`)
-- `NO COMMUNICATION 60+ DAYS` — `days_since ≥ 60` (never labeled "dead")
-- `NO DATA` — no usable upstream timestamp (not in `dac/incois`, missing or
-  unparseable Rtraj, all timestamp fields fill)
-
